join creative_interviewer center

creative_interviewer: Alright, final question for today...
creative_interviewer: How do you handle creative blocks?

# Check bubble minigame score to determine choice
if {bubble_score} >= 50:
	# Good performance - player gives correct answer
	character: I take breaks, seek inspiration from different sources, and collaborate with others
	set {interview_score} += 15

	creative_interviewer: Excellent! That shows real creative problem-solving skills.
	[signal arg="correct_choice"]
else:
	# Poor performance - player gives wrong answer  
	character: I... I usually just wait and hope for inspiration to come
	set {interview_score} -= 5

	creative_interviewer: Hmm, creativity requires more flexibility than that.
	[signal arg="wrong_choice"]

[wait time="1.0"]
[signal arg="update_ui"]
[signal arg="next_question"]